            {
                "entry_id": "8d216277-b735-3d29-8248-3f02183cbafe",
                "word": "usufructuary",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "c8359231-a2a3-4272-9e35-2522156410de",
                        "entry_id": "8d216277-b735-3d29-8248-3f02183cbafe",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "usufructuaries"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "cb64cf70-8c78-39c4-b51a-b16a17965cfc",
                        "entry_id": "8d216277-b735-3d29-8248-3f02183cbafe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who holds property, or the use of assets, by usufruct; a fructuary."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0771a1bc-90dc-4fb5-b892-dc0104f836a7",
                                "sense_id": "cb64cf70-8c78-39c4-b51a-b16a17965cfc",
                                "text": "It was queſtioned, whether Seius had ſtill the right as uſufructuary of the Profits; in regard Titius had only the property given unto him, without the fruits, and profits, belonging to Seius during his life, Julianus answered that Seius having drown'd his right as uſufructuary to the profits, in purchaſing the property, by conſolidating the ſeverall intereſts, The rights which were before diſtinguiſhed, being made one, Titius ſhall have the ſole, and full right in the Land, and Seius by his own act looſe the right of all profits, as uſufructuary to the ſame."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ffc2bb3c-ee57-473b-8f08-30876d187cd4",
                                "sense_id": "cb64cf70-8c78-39c4-b51a-b16a17965cfc",
                                "text": "[T]hat great Aſſembly des notables called by K. Francis the Firſt, to give their Judgment of the Articles of Peace lately made with the Emperour Charles V. at Madrid, their ſenſe was, that Burgundy which by thoſe Articles was to be delivered up, was an inſeparable Member of the Crown, of which he was but the uſufructuary, and ſo he could not diſpoſe of the one any more than of the other; […]"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9e92d2a0-b9fe-441d-af47-4b03e37883cb",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d216277-b735-3d29-8248-3f02183cbafe",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb64cf70-8c78-39c4-b51a-b16a17965cfc",
                        "source_sense_description": "a person who holds property, or the use of assets, by usufruct",
                        "target_lang_word": "usufruitier",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "usufruitier",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbfbd75a-5c61-3cbe-ba33-812bf9b0236b",
                                        "entry_id": "a1270768-10cc-3c0b-a891-b8ee9d3532e1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui concerne un usufruit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0c0cbbb-f9d0-48ea-b7d6-8f342fc63099",
                                                "sense_id": "fbfbd75a-5c61-3cbe-ba33-812bf9b0236b",
                                                "text": "Jouissance usufruitière."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "usufruitier",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa3db662-69c5-3014-80ff-c1868de0e45d",
                                        "entry_id": "a21a88bc-c3d1-3796-a05b-2c007f49d517",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne qui a l’usufruit."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Droit de propriété"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1c82271f-f28b-423b-9b9b-012ad7b1b166",
                                                "sense_id": "fa3db662-69c5-3014-80ff-c1868de0e45d",
                                                "text": "Pendant le démembrement qui consiste à séparer la jouissance et la nue-propriété d’un bien, l’usufruitier peut sous certaines conditions édifier des constructions, explique Olivier Rozenfeld, président de Fidroit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "494d0d99-bffd-4723-9ebf-d35de6569a50",
                                                "sense_id": "fa3db662-69c5-3014-80ff-c1868de0e45d",
                                                "text": "Le propriétaire et l’usufruitier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36a1a924-ba92-4477-9db4-ee8b6f45a76d",
                                                "sense_id": "fa3db662-69c5-3014-80ff-c1868de0e45d",
                                                "text": "Les droits et les obligations de l’usufruitier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "55a00877-5f65-4a3d-82ff-81ce50e24c1f",
                                                "sense_id": "fa3db662-69c5-3014-80ff-c1868de0e45d",
                                                "text": "Elle n’est point propriétaire de ce domaine, elle n’en est qu’usufruitière."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3664b696-b150-428d-9425-b162d2cdd824",
                        "source_entry_id": "8d216277-b735-3d29-8248-3f02183cbafe",
                        "source_sense_id": "cb64cf70-8c78-39c4-b51a-b16a17965cfc",
                        "source_sense_description": "a person who holds property, or the use of assets, by usufruct",
                        "target_lang_word": "Nutznießer",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Nutznießer",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2be2bb4b-fa78-3c3f-a910-f666c9c804e6",
                                        "entry_id": "27228946-e094-3415-9231-d8c704f6e2ae",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand, der von etwas profitiert und einen Nutzen bekommt, ohne Gegenleistung zu erbringen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3d4db39-7093-4d2e-8aee-78d212795536",
                                                "sense_id": "2be2bb4b-fa78-3c3f-a910-f666c9c804e6",
                                                "text": "Nutznießer dieser Entwicklung sind die Manager der Großkonzerne."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "800add6b-3796-4e29-8f46-3d4e51b6cab0",
                                                "sense_id": "2be2bb4b-fa78-3c3f-a910-f666c9c804e6",
                                                "text": "„Die Leute, die fünfzehn, zwanzig Jahre jünger waren als ich, die privilegierten Nutznießer der Revolution, konnten sich ihr hingeben, ohne weiter darüber nachzudenken.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
